# Belt and braces alongside outputDirectory: keep anything not needed to build
# the functions out of the deployment entirely. A no-framework project with no
# build step will otherwise serve its root directory as static files, which
# would publish migrations, source, and ten years of health notes at guessable
# URLs on a public domain.
docs/
db/
exports/
tests/
*.md
!DEPLOY.md
fitness.db*
.env
